    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/6/46355.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 10,
    "turn_text": "Plus, I asked me, as a member of the House Oversight Committee, why Republicans seem more concerned about President Biden's handling of classified documents than Donald Trump's?",
