    "turn_text": "Okay, that's hilarious. In 1973 when that clip aired, William F. Buckley Jr. supported the decriminalization of marijuana. You've been very outspoken about your views, about marijuana decriminalization, legalization. It even became, frankly, a point of vulnerability in your primary. Make the conservative case for",
